  ($lit$AC-28$lit$, $lit$blocked_by_conflict$lit$::public.t3a_d1_acceptance_outcome, $lit$Contemporaneous capture at the beat with timestamp and context needs a live run; late capture is already identified rather than disguised at the data layer.$lit$, $lit$7e597da$lit$, $lit$Claude Code, automated, non-production environment$lit$, $lit$No source is registered for serving: none of the forty holds a REC-07 approval or a source-version hash (§5.18), so no approved source instance can be rendered at a beat.$lit$),
  ($lit$AC-31$lit$, $lit$blocked_by_conflict$lit$::public.t3a_d1_acceptance_outcome, $lit$As AC-23. The rule is proved; the mentor view has no real track to lose.$lit$, $lit$7e597da$lit$, $lit$Claude Code, automated, non-production environment$lit$, $lit$Both live views are placeholders. The meeting workspace that supplies the media tracks has not landed, so there is no track to observe.$lit$),
  ($lit$AC-10$lit$, $lit$not_executed$lit$::public.t3a_d1_acceptance_outcome, $lit$Not executed in this run. Commit refusal on an unresolved served item exists at the data layer and has not been exercised as an acceptance test.$lit$, $lit$7e597da$lit$, $lit$Claude Code, automated, non-production environment$lit$, NULL),
